<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questDescription->The kiiro residents of [kiiro_settlement_label] are hosting a paper art exhibition nearby.\n\nPaper art, as an ancient and traditional art form of kiiros, has slowly declined over time. However, the kiiro paper artists, who are committed to preserving this craft, are not content with this situation. They carry the dream of revitalizing paper art and hope to draw attention and appreciation for this traditional skill through touring paper art exhibitions.\n\nAs a friend of kiiros, the paper artists also look forward to your participation.\n\nWhile you may not be familiar with kiiro paper art, art is not confined to form, and they also hope to exchange artistic insights with you.</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_OpportunitySite_PaperArtExhibition.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questDescription->[kiiro_settlement_label]的绮罗们正在附近举办纸艺展览会。\n\n纸艺作为绮罗族的一门古老而传统的艺术，如今已经慢慢没落了。而坚持传承这项手艺的绮罗纸艺师们不甘于这样的现状，她们怀揣着要将纸艺发扬光大的梦想，希望能够通过纸艺巡回展览的形式让更多的人关注和重视起这门传统手艺。\n\n作为绮罗族的朋友，纸艺师们也期待着你的参与。\n\n同时，虽然你可能并不了解绮罗的纸艺，但是艺术从来不拘泥于形式，她们也希望能够和你交流艺术方面的见解。</li>
  </Kiiro_OpportunitySite_PaperArtExhibition.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questName->paper art exhibition</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_OpportunitySite_PaperArtExhibition.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questName->纸艺展会</li>
  </Kiiro_OpportunitySite_PaperArtExhibition.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN: Quest expired: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <Kiiro_OpportunitySite_PaperArtExhibition.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>任务过期：[resolvedQuestName]</Kiiro_OpportunitySite_PaperArtExhibition.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro's paper art exhibition has come to an end. The paper artists were slightly disappointed by your absence, but they believe there will be opportunities in the future. -->
  <Kiiro_OpportunitySite_PaperArtExhibition.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>绮罗族的纸艺展会已经结束了。纸艺师们对于你的缺席略感遗憾，不过她们相信以后还会有机会。</Kiiro_OpportunitySite_PaperArtExhibition.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: [resolvedQuestName] failed -->
  <Kiiro_OpportunitySite_PaperArtExhibition.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>[resolvedQuestName]失效</Kiiro_OpportunitySite_PaperArtExhibition.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Due to the hostile relationship with the kiiros, [resolvedQuestName] cannot be completed further. -->
  <Kiiro_OpportunitySite_PaperArtExhibition.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>由于与绮罗族处于敌对关系，[resolvedQuestName]无法继续完成。</Kiiro_OpportunitySite_PaperArtExhibition.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  
</LanguageData>